cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this atlas in your research, please cite both this repository and the companion paper on African time."
title: "African Kingdoms Atlas: Pre-Colonial States, 500-1850 CE"
authors:
  - family-names: "Frigino"
    given-names: "Alex"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/afrigino/african-time-atlas"
url: "https://afrigino.github.io/african-time-atlas/"
abstract: >-
  An interactive, map-based timeline of pre-colonial African kingdoms and empires
  from 500 CE to 1850 CE, with 47 sourced states, approximate peak-extent territory
  polygons for 16 major empires, and 12 trade routes. Draws on the UNESCO General
  History of Africa and archaeological research.
keywords:
  - African history
  - historical geography
  - digital humanities
  - interactive map
  - UNESCO General History of Africa
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-05"
